{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QCpgThtMTO1795211555.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國當局將禽流感風險上調至最高級別。</p><p></p><p>法國農業、農食和糧食主權部，周五起將全國高致病性禽流感動物疫情風險級別，由中級升至高級。當局指近期多個鄰國野生鳥類中，高致病性禽流感病例增加，病毒可能沿候鳥遷徙通道傳播，而法國部分飼養場亦出現疫情。</p><p></p><p>高致病性禽流感是急性傳染病，鳥類感染後死亡率高，家禽通過接觸受感染的野生鳥類或其分泌物而感染。自8月起，法國通報6宗高致病性禽流感病例，其中3宗涉及養殖場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:04:23.970256+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T18:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:35.987892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T22:57:38.609167+00:00","content_hash":"b62c44d833acd4cd85e4bc917f78e5d9db942742c6a980fa8bcf0e1089bbc8ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:04:23.970256+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}